WEBVTT

00:12:28.850 --> 00:12:31.103
and it's how you move this message.

00:12:31.103 --> 00:12:33.436
I gave a talk like this in London a while back

00:12:33.436 --> 00:12:36.824
about this point. I said, as I say to all of you,

00:12:36.824 --> 00:12:38.970
I'm on Facebook. Friend me.

00:12:38.970 --> 00:12:41.097
Got a little laugh from the audience.

00:12:41.097 --> 00:12:46.328
There was an article which was run by AP, on the wire.

00:12:46.328 --> 00:12:48.844
Got picked up in two places in the world:

00:12:48.844 --> 00:12:51.192
Finland and Indonesia.

00:12:51.192 --> 00:12:55.082
The headline was: NATO Admiral Needs Friends.

00:12:55.082 --> 00:12:56.565
(Laughter)

00:12:56.565 --> 00:12:59.109
Thank you. (Applause)

00:12:59.109 --> 00:13:01.663
Which I do. (Laughter)